      "name": "bullet3d.collision_object.is_active",
      "brief": "Test whether a collision object is active",
      "description": "This exposes Bullet's native <code>btCollisionObject::isActive</code> result. It is\n<code>false</code> for <code>ISLAND_SLEEPING</code> and <code>DISABLE_SIMULATION</code>, and <code>true</code> for the\nother activation states available to Defold collision objects. It is\nunrelated to whether the Defold component is enabled.",
